<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A5106013" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "03" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Manual Release of Shift Lock
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
For LHD, open cap (1) at select lever assembly using a flat-bladed screwdriver.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A510036.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "51.847mm" ver = "01" gw = "198" gh = "130"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
While pushing down shift lock release button (1) at inside of cap using a flat-bladed screwdriver (2), press the select lever button (3). Check that select lever (4) shifts to other than P range.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If faulty condition is found, replace select lever assembly.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A510037.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "58.058mm" ver = "01" gw = "198" gh = "148"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
